    "body": "This is brilliant, thanks!\r\n\r\nI did give the property a try before but couldn't get it to work, it seems that I made a typo back then.\r\n\r\nI can't think of any other _useful_ changes to directory shortening right now, other than having a different property for shortening parent directories and truncated directories (to a single character).",
